repository-code: 'https://github.com/sumitsontakke/market-survinsp-ally'
url: 'https://github.com/sumitsontakke/market-survinsp-ally'
abstract: >-
  A research toolkit for detecting collusive market
  manipulation with graph neural networks. Ships as two
  independent modules with an on-disk boundary: a
  synthetic-data generator with ABIDES integration and
  configurable manipulation-family injection, and a
  detector stack (baseline GraphSAGE, bolt-on Gradient
  Boosting Machine over six engineered features, and a
  feature-augmented GraphSAGE) with a Streamlit
  investigator dashboard. Includes an evaluation harness
  for within-generator, cross-generator, and
  family-disjoint out-of-distribution regimes.
keywords:
  - market surveillance
  - graph neural networks
  - GraphSAGE
  - gradient boosting
  - out-of-distribution generalisation
  - collusive trading
  - ABIDES
  - agent-based simulation
  - financial machine learning
  - RegTech
